      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغْتَمِرٌ</span></b>  Palm-trees (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْلٌ</span>) <i>imbibing water from
a copious source.</i> (AHn, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَامِرَةٌ</span>,
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَامِرٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (assumed tropical:)  A <i>drunken</i> man: (Sgh, K,
